        "query": "-- Filter task eligibility before the ordered query boundary.\r\n-- Single-hub equality permits a hub-selective index scan;\r\n-- multiple hubs still share one global sequence order.\r\n-- Share the workflow lookup between native status and version pins.\r\nSELECT t.id FROM (\r\n  SELECT id,sequence,hub_id,task_type,workflow_id FROM wfc_scale.hub_task\r\n  WHERE state IN ($5,$6) AND attempts < max_attempts\r\n    AND hub_id = $1\r\n    AND partition_id % $7 = ANY($2)\r\n    AND hub_id || $8 || task_type || $9 || task_version::text = ANY($3)\r\n    AND ((state = $10 AND due_at <= now()) OR\r\n         (state = $11 A",
